phase_readme = "# Networking\n\n## Scope\nVNets, subnets, NSGs, VNet peering, private DNS, Load Balancer, Application\nGateway, Bastion, VPN Gateway, Network Watcher. The most expensive week in\nthe whole build - see the cost strategy in the root README before deploying\nanything here."
